+      frame, QR Code Monster kept redrawing the background: on Dance_2 the background changed 4 times more
+      from frame to frame. On black or inverted silhouettes it keeps the whole frame, which is their point.
+    - The pose unit gets the same region, so a skeleton found on someone in the background (who is left out
+      of the dancers' masks) draws nothing.
